}, {"widget": {"name": "color_correction"}, "name": "color_correction", "label": "color_correction", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "color_correction"}, {"widget": {"name": "temporal_overlap"}, "shape": 7, "name": "temporal_overlap", "label": "temporal_overlap", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "temporal_overlap"}, {"widget": {"name": "prepend_frames"}, "shape": 7, "name": "prepend_frames", "label": "prepend_frames", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "prepend_frames"}, {"widget": {"name": "input_noise_scale"}, "shape": 7, "name": "input_noise_scale", "label": "input_noise_scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "input_noise_scale"}, {"widget": {"name": "latent_noise_scale"}, "shape": 7, "name": "latent_noise_scale", "label": "latent_noise_scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "latent_noise_scale"}, {"widget": {"name": "offload_device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "offload_device", "label": "offload_device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "offload_device"}, {"widget": {"name": "enable_debug"}, "shape": 7, "name": "enable_debug", "label": "enable_debug", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "enable_debug"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SeedVR2VideoUpscaler", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [343.1535339355469, 386], "pos": [2965.68505859375, 861.5341796875], "id": 4, "properties": {"cnr_id": "seedvr2_videoupscaler", "ver": "912ab4a5da8bb3590c4659f8f19160a7bd88a656", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"color_correction": true, "batch_size": true, "seed": true, "uniform_batch_size": true, "enable_debug": true, "latent_noise_scale": true, "prepend_frames": true, "offload_device": true, "temporal_overlap": true, "input_noise_scale": true, "resolution": true, "max_resolution": true}, "Node name for S&R": "SeedVR2VideoUpscaler", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#535", "groupcolor": "#a1309b", "color": "#323"}}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [2, 6], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["lanczos", 0.30000000000000004, 1], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 1, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upscale_method"}, "name": "upscale_method", "label": "upscale_method", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "缩放方法"}, {"widget": {"name": "megapixels"}, "name": "megapixels", "label": "megapixels", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "像素数量"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution_steps"}, "name": "resolution_steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "resolution_steps"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ImageScaleToTotalPixels", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [230, 106], "pos": [2007.7476806640625, 829.5511474609375], "id": 3, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.62", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.3"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ImageScaleToTotalPixels"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# SeedVR2 Video Upscaler (v2.5.15) 参数详解\n\n## 一、核心输入参数\n- **image** — 输入待放大的视频帧序列（图像批次）\n- **dit** — DiT（Diffusion Transformer）模型，用于扩散去噪过程\n- **vae** — VAE 编码器/解码器，用于图像与潜空间的转换\n\n---\n\n## 二、生成控制参数\n- **seed** — 随机种子，控制生成过程的随机性（默认：`476473713`）\n- **control_after_generate** — 生成后种子处理方式\n  - `randomize` — 随机化（默认）\n  - `fixed` — 固定\n  - `increment` — 递增\n\n---\n\n## 三、分辨率控制\n- **resolution** — 目标输出分辨率，短边长度（默认：`2048`）\n- **max_resolution** — 最大允许分辨率限制，防止显存溢出（默认：`4096`）\n\n---\n\n## 四、批次处理参数\n- **batch_size** — 每批处理的帧数，影响显存占用和速度（默认：`5`）\n- **uniform_batch_size** — 是否强制统一批次大小（默认：`false`）\n\n---\n\n## 五、色彩校正（color_correction）\n\n### 功能说明\n- 修正放大过程中的色彩偏移，使输出匹配原始输入色彩\n\n### 可选模式\n- **lab** — 感知色彩匹配，保留细节（**推荐，默认**）\n- **wavelet** — 基于频率的自然色彩，保留精细细节\n- **wavelet_adaptive** — 小波基底 + 针对性饱和度校正\n- **hsv** — 基于色相的条件饱和度匹配\n- **adain** — 统计风格迁移方法\n- **none** — 不应用色彩校正\n\n---\n\n## 六、时序处理参数\n- **temporal_overlap** — 帧间时序重叠数量，提升连贯性但增加计算量（默认：`0`）\n- **prepend_frames** — 序列前填充帧数，处理首帧时序上下文（默认：`0`）\n\n---\n\n## 七、噪声控制参数\n- **input_noise_scale** — 输入图像噪声缩放，增加可提升细节（默认：`0.000`）\n- **latent_noise_scale** — 潜空间噪声缩放，控制扩散随机性（默认：`0.000`）\n\n---\n\n## 八、系统优化参数\n- **offload_device** — 模型卸载设备\n  - `cpu` — 内存充足时使用（默认）\n  - `gpu` — 显存充足时使用\n- **enable_debug** — 启用调试模式，输出详细日志（默认：`false`）\n\n---\n\n## 九、使用建议\n\n### 显存配置\n- **显存充足（24GB+）** — `offload_device: gpu`，适当提高 `batch_size`\n- **显存有限（8-12GB）** — `offload_device: cpu`，降低 `batch_size` 到 2-3\n\n### 色彩需求\n- **追求色彩还原** — `lab`（默认）或 `wavelet`\n- **艺术风格迁移** — `adain`\n\n### 其他场景\n- **快速测试** — 降低 `resolution` 和 `max_resolution`\n- **长视频处理** — 增加 `temporal_overlap` 保证连贯性"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [725.0248413085938, 1510.68603515625], "pos": [165.91159057617188, 601.69482421875], "id": 35, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "image_urls", "dir": 4, "type": "STRING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [[{"name": "A", "selected": true, "url": "/view?filename=rgthree.compare._temp_gdpvt_00001_pveac_1781165299.jpg&type=temp&subfolder=&rand=0.8589999032919824&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiJkNTdlY2Y5Yzg4Yjg2NDY4YjBkMTRmMWIxNzRiM2MzZCIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3ODE3Njk3NDYzMTYsInRzIjoxNzgxMTY0OTQ2MzE2LCJzaWduIjoiMDY1MDQ0MjVlOWY5ODYyZTdlNDRhNDFjMDRmYjE4OTIifQ==&Rh-Identify=d57ecf9c88b86468b0d14f1b174b3c3d"}, {"name": "B", "selected": true, "url": "/view?filename=rgthree.compare._temp_gdpvt_00002_ptxft_1781165302.jpg&type=temp&subfolder=&rand=0.27296192125482&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiJkNTdlY2Y5Yzg4Yjg2NDY4YjBkMTRmMWIxNzRiM2MzZCIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3ODE3Njk3NDYzMTYsInRzIjoxNzgxMTY0OTQ2MzE2LCJzaWduIjoiMDY1MDQ0MjVlOWY5ODYyZTdlNDRhNDFjMDRmYjE4OTIifQ==&Rh-Identify=d57ecf9c88b86468b0d14f1b174b3c3d"}]], "inputs": [{"name": "image_a", "link": 7, "label": "图像_A", "dir": 3, "type": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "image_b", "link": 8, "label": "图像_B", "dir": 3, "type": "IMAGE"}], "flag